        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coziest Cat Decorating Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where warmth, charm, and creativity come together — a delightful home decorating game filled with fluffy cats, soft colors, and endless cozy vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this heartwarming experience, your goal is simple yet irresistibly satisfying:<br>place each piece of furniture and every adorable cat in just the right spot to bring each room to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snug little bedrooms to elegant living spaces and sunny balconies, every level offers a brand-new scene waiting for your personal touch. Arrange, decorate, and create harmony between home and cat — because a perfect room isn’t complete without a purring friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, relax, and let your creativity flow. Whether you’re a design lover, a cat enthusiast, or just someone who enjoys calm, feel-good moments — this game is made to warm your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Beautiful, hand-crafted rooms full of charm and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐱 Adorable cats with unique poses and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 A gentle puzzle twist — place each object where it truly belongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💖 Soothing music and cozy visuals for the ultimate relaxing vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream cat home — one cozy room at a time.</p>",
